b.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkr9.jpg"}, {"id": 1566550, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkra.jpg"}, {"id": 1566551, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkrb.jpg"}, {"id": 1566552, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkrc.jpg"}, {"id": 1566553, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkrd.jpg"}, {"id": 1566554, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkre.jpg"}, {"id": 1566557, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxkrh.jpg"}], "slug": "mr-photographer-into-the-light", "storyline": "Meet your drone companion\u2014a tool that can be as much a challenge as it is a helper. Colliding with it depletes your health and may even cost you a life. Yet, with the right collectable item, the remote, you can take control of your drone, turning it into a valuable ally. Jump on it to access hidden areas or solve complex platforming puzzles. However, just like real drones, it might get stuck behind obstacles, testing your patience and timing.", "summary": "Dive into the captivating world of \"Mr. Photographer - Into the Light\", an action-packed platformer where every moment challenges your wit, strategy, and skill. With no paywalls or in-game purchases, this is a pure test of talent, patience, and wisdom. Every game is a fresh start, and every adventure demands a unique approach. Are you ready to rise from an intern to a master photographer?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mr-photographer-into-the-light"}